e":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322097206:1":{"text":"我曾经最希望的，就是能和其他同龄人一起在外面奔跑、打闹，滚得全身泥泞。可惜啊，直到我死亡都没能实现这个愿望。","source_cn":"我曾经最希望的，就是能和其他同龄人一起在外面奔跑、打闹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D1D39E93560ED4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322097207:1":{"text":"而现在，成为了亡灵，经历了这么长的岁月，见过了太多的生死和普通人恐惧的眼神，我已经不再奢求友情。","source_cn":"而现在，成为了亡灵，经历了这么长的岁月，见过了太多的生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x797C06BD4D2BA423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322097208:0":{"text":"可童年的碎片掠影偶尔浮现时，我还是会想着……如果那时卧病的我能有更多朋友，该有多好。","source_cn":"可童年的碎片掠影偶尔浮现时，我还是会想着……如果那时卧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CEF120D3D21F36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322097209:1":{"text":"……是这样的吗？","source_cn":"……是这样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D17961D7769553C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322097210:1":{"text":"即便那会加重你的病情，让你的父母垂泪……？","source_cn":"即便那会加重你的病情，让你的父母垂泪……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BDABEFFAD05B638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu